# The patch series and the overlay self-test fixture are applied verbatim with
# `git apply` against LF-normalised targets.  A CRLF checkout of a .patch (or of
# a fixture file a patch is applied to) would make the hunks fail to apply on a
# Windows checkout, so pin these trees to LF and never let git rewrite them.
patches/**                 -text
cmake/selftest/fixture/**  -text
